ssociation":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot Engine v4.6.1.stable.official.14d19694e - https://godotengine.org\n\n\n### System information\n\nD3D12 12_0 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti\n\nWindows 11 Home, Version 25H2, OS build 26200.8037\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen running a scene, even a completely empty project, will have the mouse freeze in position when pressing a button on the keyboard. This also happens if the code processes the key.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Run current scene\n2. Press any keyboard button except shift, ctrl, alt, arrows. Any other key (e.g. w, a, s, d, numpad, F-keys) will freeze the mouse in place.\n3. Try to move the mouse.\n4. Release key\n5. Mouse moves freely. \n6. Keep moving the mouse and press keyboard button. Mouse freezes again.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mouse_freeze_on_button_press.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26687263/mouse_freeze_on_button_press.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"gijsje789","id":33655872,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU1ODcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33655872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gijsje789","html_url":"https://github.com/gijsje789","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gijsje789/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gijsje789/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gijsje789/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gijsje789/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gijsje789/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gijsje789/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gijsje789/repos","events_url":"https://api.